<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.25;color:#0a0a0a;">
  We could not cancel your order
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5ba60b;">
  Status update
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  We could not cancel order <strong>#{{order_number}}</strong> because it is currently
  <strong>{{order_status}}</strong>. Orders in this status can no longer be cancelled.
</p>

{{#> details}}
  {{> detail-row label="Order number" value=order_number}}
  {{> detail-row label="Status" value=order_status}}
{{/details}}

{{#> tip title="What to do next"}}
  If you still need help with this order, reply to this email and our support team will assist.
{{/tip}}

<p style="margin:0;">
  Thank you for shopping with Dukka.
</p>
